{"shortDescription":"RNS Number : 0613W  SDI Group PLC  24 September 2026   SDI Group plc(“SDI”, the “Company” or the “Group”)Grant of Share Option Awards24 September 2026 – SDI Group plc, the buy and build group, focused on companies which design and manufacture specialist lab equipment, industrial \u0026 scientific sensor…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":["RNS Number : 0613W  SDI Group PLC  24 September 2026   ",{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["SDI Group plc"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["(“SDI”, the “Company” or the “Group”)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Grant of Share Option Awards"]},{"type":"p","children":["24 September 2026 – SDI Group plc, the buy and build group, focused on companies which design and manufacture specialist lab equipment, industrial \u0026 scientific sensors and industrial \u0026 scientific products, announces details of the grant of share option awards on 23 September 2026 to the Company’s Executive Directors in respect of Ordinary Shares of 1 pence each in the Company."]},{"type":"p","children":["Two separate awards were granted to each Executive Director. The first award is a deferred bonus award in respect of SDI’s financial year ended 30 April 2026 granted under the Company’s Long Term Incentive Plan 2025 (\"LTIP\"). The second award is a performance based LTIP award, also granted under the Company’s Long Term Incentive Plan 2025 (together, the \"Grants\")."]},{"type":"p","children":["The deferred bonus awards have an exercise price per share of 1 pence and are exercisable one year from the grant date and have no performance conditions."]},{"type":"p","children":["The LTIP awards have an exercise price per share of 1 pence and are ordinarily exercisable three years from the grant date subject to continued service and to the extent that performance conditions measured over a 3-year performance period are met. The LTIP awards are also subject to net of tax post vesting holding period to be determined by the Remuneration Committee. The performance conditions for the awards are linked to the Company's growth in EPS and total shareholder return."]},{"type":"p","children":["Each of the awards is subject to the rules of the LTIP including its good/bad leaver terms and its malus and claw back provisions."]},{"type":"p","children":["The following awards have been made:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Name"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Role"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["LTIP award"]},{"type":"p","children":["(no. of shares)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Vesting Date"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Deferred bonus award"]},{"type":"p","children":["(no. of shares)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Vesting Date"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Total options following the Grants"]},{"type":"p","children":["(no of shares)"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Stephen Brown"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Chief Executive Officer"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["353,863"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["24 September 2029"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["303,589"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["23 September 2027"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["1,947,580"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Amitabh Sharma"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Chief Financial Officer"]}]},{"type":"table-data